+/*
+cl_avatar.c - H9: players' havoc9.org pictures on the scoreboard (docs/PLAYER_LIMIT_128.txt, 11.7)
+Copyright (C) 2026 HAVOC 9
+
+This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
